1
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,649
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,691 --> 00:00:12,210
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,359
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,401 --> 00:00:18,970
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,929
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:21,971 --> 00:00:26,370
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:28,309
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,351 --> 00:00:29,839
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:29,881 --> 00:00:31,329
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,371 --> 00:00:33,210
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,179
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,221 --> 00:00:36,789
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,831 --> 00:00:38,239
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,281 --> 00:00:42,439
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,481 --> 00:00:44,460
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:48,750 --> 00:00:50,110
Where exactly are you taking me?

17
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:53,750
To see the person
you've been longing for.

18
00:00:54,030 --> 00:00:56,600
I always keep my word.

19
00:01:01,180 --> 00:01:03,220
=Episode 20=

20
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,310
Thank you.

21
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:10,430
Ms. Lu.

22
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:14,040
Jingchen.

23
00:01:19,510 --> 00:01:20,510
Commander He.

24
00:01:21,430 --> 00:01:23,590
Look, I've even fattened your girl up.

25
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,200
See?

26
00:01:25,350 --> 00:01:27,350
I told you I'd treat your savior well.

27
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:29,280
(She didn't tell him.)

28
00:01:31,710 --> 00:01:32,790
What?

29
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:33,409
I...

30
00:01:33,451 --> 00:01:34,560
Did I gain weight?

31
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:36,480
All right.

32
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:39,560
I'm giving her back to you.

33
00:01:39,790 --> 00:01:40,590
You two talk.

34
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:41,950
I'll step outside for some air.

35
00:01:50,790 --> 00:01:53,790
No wonder you drew the Six-Eared Macaque
fighting Sun Wukong.

36
00:01:55,510 --> 00:01:56,310
Jingchen.

37
00:01:56,480 --> 00:01:57,710
What are you talking about?

38
00:01:58,070 --> 00:01:59,430
I don't understand.

39
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,350
Keep pretending.

40
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:03,310
You started lying to me

41
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:05,200
the moment I found your ring

42
00:02:05,590 --> 00:02:06,920
at the Governor's Residence.

43
00:02:13,590 --> 00:02:14,520
That's mine.

44
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,910
Please give it back, sir.

45
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,030
This ring...

46
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,360
Where did you get it?

47
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:27,680
A boy I saved when I was young
gave it to me.

48
00:02:28,470 --> 00:02:29,590
When and where?

49
00:02:30,590 --> 00:02:31,449
Eight years ago.

50
00:02:31,491 --> 00:02:32,870
The woodshed
in Yingchun Brothel's back courtyard.

51
00:02:33,310 --> 00:02:34,520
He escaped that night.

52
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:36,009
When I went back,

53
00:02:36,051 --> 00:02:37,360
I only found this ring,

54
00:02:37,870 --> 00:02:40,030
wrapped in the handkerchief
I'd used to wrap his buns.

55
00:02:42,710 --> 00:02:44,659
Then how did you know

56
00:02:44,701 --> 00:02:46,430
Su Yutang was the girl from back then?

57
00:02:46,870 --> 00:02:48,030
I may have been blind,

58
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,710
but after all this time,

59
00:02:51,150 --> 00:02:52,360
even I could see the truth.

60
00:02:52,630 --> 00:02:54,470
A fake can never become real,

61
00:02:55,150 --> 00:02:56,240
nor the real become fake.

62
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:59,840
Then why didn't she tell you herself?

63
00:03:01,910 --> 00:03:02,840
She's not like you.

64
00:03:03,910 --> 00:03:05,400
She wouldn't use a debt of gratitude
to trick someone into loving her.

65
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:19,910
Finished talking?

66
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:21,190
Can we go now?

67
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:22,750
You head back first.

68
00:03:23,910 --> 00:03:24,750
I'll take her to the station.

69
00:03:25,310 --> 00:03:26,000
The station?

70
00:03:26,910 --> 00:03:27,840
Where are you sending her?

71
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:28,750
The world's a big place.

72
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:30,840
Where she goes

73
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,000
is up to her.

74
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:36,870
Thank you for saving me.

75
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:43,000
Su Yutang.

76
00:03:43,430 --> 00:03:44,750
He Jingchen is

77
00:03:44,910 --> 00:03:46,129
cold and insensitive.

78
00:03:46,171 --> 00:03:47,840
He has no idea
how to treat women gently.

79
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:50,430
If he ever confesses to you,

80
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:51,960
think it over carefully.

81
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:55,360
If you have any other choice,

82
00:03:56,750 --> 00:03:57,840
don't choose him.

83
00:03:59,240 --> 00:03:59,910
I'm leaving.

84
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:01,080
Take care.

85
00:05:12,100 --> 00:05:13,300
(Governor's Residence)

86
00:05:17,220 --> 00:05:18,540
(Governor's Residence)

87
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:35,950
(Hurry!)

88
00:05:37,430 --> 00:05:38,630
(Everyone inside, come out!)

89
00:05:38,750 --> 00:05:39,920
(Don't waste a second!)

90
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,800
(Get to the front courtyard!
Crouch down, hands on your heads!)

91
00:05:52,390 --> 00:05:53,560
(Hurry!)

92
00:05:54,310 --> 00:05:54,899
(Move!)

93
00:05:54,941 --> 00:05:55,729
(Search everywhere!)

94
00:05:55,771 --> 00:05:56,560
Come out!

95
00:05:57,070 --> 00:05:58,270
I'm coming out! Don't shoot!

96
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,720
Don't shoot!

97
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:00,950
Move!

98
00:06:30,830 --> 00:06:31,510
My dear son-in-law.

99
00:06:32,830 --> 00:06:34,870
I'm entrusting my daughter to you.

100
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:35,830
Go on.

101
00:06:39,310 --> 00:06:40,160
Once you reach Lancheng,

102
00:06:40,510 --> 00:06:41,800
send word as soon as possible.

103
00:06:42,310 --> 00:06:43,240
Rest assured, Governor.

104
00:06:44,430 --> 00:06:45,830
I'll take good care of Yutang.

105
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:47,510
The auspicious hour has arrived.

106
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:49,800
Please perform the farewell bows
to the governor.

107
00:06:50,220 --> 00:06:52,060
(Gentle Breezes Bring Harmony)

108
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:13,409
You two, over there.

109
00:07:13,451 --> 00:07:13,920
Yes.

110
00:07:14,390 --> 00:07:15,049
Sir.

111
00:07:15,091 --> 00:07:15,920
Nothing here.

112
00:07:16,070 --> 00:07:17,040
Sir. Nothing here.

113
00:07:18,870 --> 00:07:20,019
Sir. Nothing here.

114
00:07:20,061 --> 00:07:21,000
Sir. Nothing here.

115
00:07:29,190 --> 00:07:29,870
First bow.

116
00:07:40,870 --> 00:07:41,560
Second bow.

117
00:07:49,260 --> 00:07:53,260
(Serenity)

118
00:07:54,870 --> 00:07:55,560
Third bow.

119
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:22,480
Rise.

120
00:08:25,190 --> 00:08:25,870
Jingchen.

121
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:28,270
Escort Ms. Lu to Lancheng.

122
00:08:28,870 --> 00:08:31,240
I won't let you down, Governor.

123
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:04,099
Yutang.

124
00:09:04,141 --> 00:09:04,440
Quick!

125
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:06,510
Are you all right?

126
00:09:22,870 --> 00:09:23,720
Protect the governor!

127
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:34,750
Watch out, Governor!

128
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:07,030
Commander He.

129
00:10:07,390 --> 00:10:08,240
Once this is over,

130
00:10:08,550 --> 00:10:09,270
as for Yang and Qin...

131
00:10:09,910 --> 00:10:11,200
I know what you're going to say.

132
00:10:11,630 --> 00:10:12,320
Don't worry.

133
00:10:12,790 --> 00:10:13,889
I've kept your concerns

134
00:10:13,931 --> 00:10:15,030
in mind.

135
00:10:24,030 --> 00:10:24,720
Yutang.

136
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,150
Yutang.

137
00:10:26,630 --> 00:10:27,390
Don't be afraid.

138
00:10:27,750 --> 00:10:28,440
Father's here.

139
00:10:30,670 --> 00:10:31,360
Young Master Rong.

140
00:10:31,790 --> 00:10:32,600
Don't be afraid.

141
00:10:33,030 --> 00:10:34,609
With me, Lu Zhentian, here,

142
00:10:34,651 --> 00:10:36,790
no one would dare touch us.

143
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:38,910
Commander He.

144
00:10:39,270 --> 00:10:40,459
Staff Officer Chen's side...

145
00:10:40,501 --> 00:10:41,150
It's done.

146
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:44,870
Open the door.

147
00:10:47,270 --> 00:10:48,150
All of you, shut up!

148
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:48,910
Stop yelling!

149
00:10:49,120 --> 00:10:50,600
Boy, do you know who I am?

150
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:52,339
I'm Lu Zhentian.

151
00:10:52,381 --> 00:10:54,720
Tell your boss to get over here now.

152
00:10:54,790 --> 00:10:55,249
Don't be afraid.

153
00:10:55,291 --> 00:10:56,550
I want to know who he is!

154
00:10:57,240 --> 00:10:57,960
It's me.

155
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:01,870
He Jingchen.

156
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:06,790
So you're the wolf
who's been plotting against me.

157
00:11:15,550 --> 00:11:16,750
I'm flattered, Governor.

158
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:20,270
After all,

159
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:22,480
you're Fancheng's Iron Leopard.

160
00:11:23,510 --> 00:11:24,840
If I weren't a wolf,

161
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:27,550
how could I go up against a leopard?

162
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:29,030
Why?

163
00:11:29,630 --> 00:11:31,670
You grew up at the Governor's Residence.

164
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:33,150
I treated you well.

165
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:36,720
Do you remember

166
00:11:37,550 --> 00:11:39,910
the maid who let
the Second Concubine escape?

167
00:11:41,700 --> 00:11:43,280
Darn you!

168
00:11:43,510 --> 00:11:46,419
You dared let my favorite woman escape?

169
00:11:46,461 --> 00:11:47,550
I'll kill you!

170
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:04,960
You're that maid's son.

171
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:08,000
Now you remember.

172
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:10,790
Fine.

173
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:13,390
I'll give you some time

174
00:12:13,790 --> 00:12:15,840
to recall the other sins
you've committed.

175
00:12:18,870 --> 00:12:19,550
Come on.

176
00:12:21,150 --> 00:12:22,320
Your turn.

177
00:12:24,150 --> 00:12:24,840
Commander He.

178
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:26,360
The governor killed your mother.

179
00:12:26,550 --> 00:12:27,720
Yutang had nothing to do with it.

180
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:29,579
You and I have no grudge either.

181
00:12:29,621 --> 00:12:31,150
Why do this to my wife and me?

182
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:34,270
Your wife already?

183
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:55,750
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

184
00:12:57,800 --> 00:13:01,139
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

185
00:13:01,181 --> 00:13:03,810
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

186
00:13:05,310 --> 00:13:06,869
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

187
00:13:06,911 --> 00:13:11,010
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

188
00:13:11,550 --> 00:13:16,960
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

189
00:13:18,550 --> 00:13:21,869
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

190
00:13:21,911 --> 00:13:25,219
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

191
00:13:25,261 --> 00:13:27,779
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

192
00:13:27,821 --> 00:13:30,800
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

193
00:13:31,070 --> 00:13:37,320
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

194
00:13:37,810 --> 00:13:41,119
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

195
00:13:41,161 --> 00:13:44,349
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

196
00:13:44,391 --> 00:13:51,119
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

197
00:13:51,161 --> 00:13:54,369
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

198
00:13:54,411 --> 00:13:57,809
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

199
00:13:57,851 --> 00:13:59,970
♪Boundless♪
